$PrivacyPolicy ="Evo Movement International S.A. de C.V.";
$PrivacyPolicy_sub = "Global Privacy and Cookies Policy";
$PrivacyPolicy_01_text_01 ="Please read carefully. Evo Movement International S.A. de C.V…, together with its subsidiaries and affiliates (collectively, “Evo Global”, “we”, “us” or “our”), recognizes the importance of protecting your privacy. Our Global Privacy and Cookies Policy (“Policy”) applies to your use of our global public websites (collectively, the “Site”), as well as to your interactions with Evo Global’s officers, employees, and contractors. This Policy is designed to help you understand how we collect, use, safeguard, and disclose your personal information, and your choices to make informed decisions when using the Site. We also describe how you can contact us about our privacy practices. Global Web Privacy Policy. Your acceptance through use. This Global Web Privacy Policy describes how Evo Global collects, uses, and discloses certain personal information obtained through this Site. Please note that, to the extent permitted by applicable law, your use of this Site implies your understanding and acceptance of the terms of this Global Web Privacy Policy. This Global Web Privacy Policy is incorporated into and forms part of the Terms of Use, which govern your use of the Site in general. The types of information we collect. We may collect information about you from a variety of sources. This includes information we collect directly from you; information you provide to us or on behalf of your Evo Global Independent Business Owner (“IBO”) in order to provide you with a better customer experience; information we collect about you when you visit our sites or view Evo Global online ads; and information we collect about you from other sources (where permitted by law). Information we collect directly from you: We collect information directly from you when you choose to participate in our offers and programs or provide us with information directly. The following are examples of information we may collect directly from you:";

