$PrivacyPolicy_01_text_03 ="Your product or service choices and preferences. How we use your information. Communications with you – Offers and services you expressed interest in: When you visit or conduct business transactions on our Site, you may need to register with us or be asked to provide us with personal and account information. When you provide us this information, we may use it to contact you about offers or services in which you have expressed interest. Evo Global has a legitimate business interest in using the personal information we collect from you to provide such requested services. However, where we rely on your consent, if you tell us that you do not want us to use this information as a basis for further contact with you (by accessing our opt-out procedure described below), we will respect your wishes. Communications with you – Newsletters and marketing purposes: In order to keep our users and customers informed about our latest news, products, and services, we may send emails and marketing communications to the email address you provided when registering on our Site or when requesting information from us. Evo Global complies with applicable laws in using your personal information for this purpose, and where required (such as in Mexico) relies on your consent. Please note that we sometimes partner with third parties to send marketing communications promoting third-party products and services (for example, those of our business partners) as well as our own. If you subscribed to any of our mailing lists, newsletters, or other promotional offers and then decide you no longer wish to receive such newsletters or promotional emails from us, you may unsubscribe by following the instructions contained in each email we send you (or use the opt-out procedure described below). Professional interactions with you – Relationship management: We may use your relationship data (collected when you communicate with an Evo Global employee or agent by phone or email, for