$PrivacyPolicy_03 ="Legally affiliated entities:";
$PrivacyPolicy_03_text ="In the event that Evo Global merges, or in the event of a transfer of our assets, Site, or operations, Evo Global may disclose or transfer your personal information in connection with such transaction. In the case of such a transfer, Evo Global will notify you by email or by posting a prominent notice on our Site for 30 days of any change in ownership of Evo Global that results in a change of control of your personal information. We may also share your personal information with affiliates of Evo Global’s Independent Business Owners (“IBOs”) in order to provide or offer you products or services. Legally required disclosure: We will also disclose your personal information when required by law, for example, in response to a court order, subpoena, or other legal obligation, in response to legitimate requests from public authorities, including to meet national security or law enforcement requirements, or in special cases where we have reason to believe that disclosing your personal information is necessary to identify, contact, or take legal action against someone who may be causing harm or interference (whether intentional or not) with our rights or property.";

