$PrivacyPolicy_07 ="Changes to this Policy.";
$PrivacyPolicy_07_text ="We are a rapidly evolving global business. We will continue to evaluate this Policy against new technologies and services, business practices, and our customers’ needs, and we will make changes to this Policy from time to time as necessary. If we make any substantial changes to this Policy, we will make the changes here and, if the changes are significant, we will provide more prominent notice (including, for certain services, email notification of Policy changes). Cookie Policy – Automatic Data Collection. By browsing our Site, you agree to our use of cookies. What is a Cookie: A cookie is a small text file that a website stores on your personal computer, phone, or any other device, with information about your browsing on that website. Cookies make browsing easier and more user-friendly. A cookie contains the name of the server it comes from, the cookie’s expiration date, and a value, usually a randomly generated unique number. Cookies do not give access to or damage your computer. How we use Cookies: We use browser session cookies, which are temporary cookies that are erased from your device’s memory when you close your internet browser or turn off your computer, and persistent cookies, which are stored on your device until they expire, unless you delete them earlier. If you would like more information about third-party cookies on our website and learn more about your option not to have your information used by third parties, please contact us at support@evoglobal.online. Contact us. You can always contact us if you have questions or concerns about this Policy, have a question or problem related to use of the Site, or wish to opt out of your personal information being used for our direct marketing purposes. Our standard business practice is to retain any communication from visitors to our Site to help us better serve each of you. You may contact us by sending an email to support@evoglobal.online or writing to us at Calle Buenavista 31 int 4, Colonia Barrio del Niño Jesús, Mexico City, Mexico.";

